\section{Conclusion}

The CO-ASDI pipeline achieves deterministic, cryptographically verifiable, exascale 
throughput under maximal stress conditions. The formal stability theorem demonstrates 
that the architecture maintains bounded latency and zero data loss even under 
post-quantum cryptographic load and trillion-particle simulation regimes.

